{"events": [{"tStartMs": 12100, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "女士们,先生们,美国总统,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 15500, "dDurationMs": 4500, "segs": [{"utf8": "唐纳德·特朗普(Donald J. Trump),随同主席兼首席执行官", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 20000, "dDurationMs": 3700, "segs": [{"utf8": "(原始内容存档于2018-10-21). UFC, Dana White.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 65600, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "非常感谢 请坐 享受", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 69100, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "你们自己 对我来说,这是伟大的享受,因为我们", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 71900, "dDurationMs": 3800, "segs": [{"utf8": "赞美伟大 赞美人民和人民", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 75700, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "与他们合作。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 77900, "dDurationMs": 5100, "segs": [{"utf8": "今天,我很荣幸欢迎各位 来到我们的第一位官员", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 83000, "dDurationMs": 4200, "segs": [{"utf8": "新白宫直升机停机坪上的事件", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 87200, "dDurationMs": 1500, "segs": [{"utf8": "这是一个大的。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 88700, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "我说,给我一个直升机停机坪。 我不知道会是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 90700, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "这么大,但人们喜欢它。 其实,这是那么好的我", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 92900, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "我建它的时候都没被起诉", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 96100, "dDurationMs": 1900, "segs": [{"utf8": "这是他们想要起诉。 他们已经有了它。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 98000, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "然后他们看到,他们说,不好, 这东西是惊人的。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 101400, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "这一切都会是惊人的,这将是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 103400, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "最令人惊奇的是,我们正在为白人建造的东西", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 106000, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "- 房子 - 为什么? - House. 他们已经找了150年了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 109600, "dDurationMs": 4300, "segs": [{"utf8": "舞厅和里面的军事建筑群", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 113900, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "但是今天下午,我很高兴宣布我的好", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 116200, "dDurationMs": 4292, "segs": [{"utf8": "朋友达纳 白人,一个传说, 一个真正的传说,一个男人他", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 120492, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "我亲自向总统介绍他的联合", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 124092, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国海军陆战队有一笔捐款", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 126892, "dDurationMs": 4700, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在开始是20万 我说了多少人", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 131592, "dDurationMs": 3800, "segs": [{"utf8": "是吗? 我以为有70,但大约170。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 135392, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "我不知道有多少人加入进来。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 137692, "dDurationMs": 3300, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以我们决定增加,对不对?", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 140992, "dDurationMs": 2633, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以,我们打算给20万 我们现在正做它", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 143625, "dDurationMs": 3767, "segs": [{"utf8": "五十万块 今诸人取出多相.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 147392, "dDurationMs": 3700, "segs": [{"utf8": "好吗? 那要花一秒钟才能拿到", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 151092, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "从达纳。 我说你要不要去双倍?", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 153992, "dDurationMs": 4600, "segs": [{"utf8": "这是我们的荣誉,因为它是一个很好的小数量", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 158592, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "钱和它真的很美妙。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 161992, "dDurationMs": 4400, "segs": [{"utf8": "这真的开始是因为我和Dana在战斗中", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 166392, "dDurationMs": 4700, "segs": [{"utf8": "这是全世界史上最高等级的战斗", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 171092, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "但音乐很棒", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 174192, "dDurationMs": 2100, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在,战斗是伟大的, 他们是最好的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 176292, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "和谁打过仗 最后一场是最后两场", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 179892, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "战斗,但你可以看到 每一个战斗是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 183892, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "最终击倒了所有伟大的冠军", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 187292, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "每个人都是冠军 这是最棒的夜晚", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 190492, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "应该是可怕的天气。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 193092, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们不知道会发生什么。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 195092, "dDurationMs": 3071, "segs": [{"utf8": "事实上,我们推迟是因为我们想 如果你活了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 198163, "dDurationMs": 3429, "segs": [{"utf8": "那边一英里或那边一英里 朋友叫我起来", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 201592, "dDurationMs": 2500, "segs": [{"utf8": "说你怎么打?", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 204092, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "云一到白宫就来了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 207292, "dDurationMs": 3700, "segs": [{"utf8": "就在那边 他们打开了一切", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 210992, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "湿透了 我们没有一滴。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 213392, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们在等 这是不好的。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 214992, "dDurationMs": 3700, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们说过我们有大麻烦了 但这是奇迹", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 218692, "dDurationMs": 3300, "segs": [{"utf8": "晚上和白宫的背景", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 221992, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "戒指就在这里 我开始", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 225392, "dDurationMs": 3900, "segs": [{"utf8": "第二天建造的,正是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 229292, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "整个[鼻]环的大小,那是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 232692, "dDurationMs": 4500, "segs": [{"utf8": "争吵一下 公园里有十万人", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 237192, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "这里大概有60007000人", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 240692, "dDurationMs": 1700, "segs": [{"utf8": "白宫的背景。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 242392, "dDurationMs": 1902, "segs": [{"utf8": "我不认为它会 永远不会再次发生,丹娜。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 244294, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "我不这么认为。 而且,他们是最好的战斗。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 247094, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "贾斯汀·盖斯杰赢了.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 249494, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "他没有被宠爱。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 252194, "dDurationMs": 3300, "segs": [{"utf8": "并出战平生之争并取胜.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 255494, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "做了很多伤害。 他赢得了很多损失。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 259094, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "但人们说这是他们最伟大的事件之一", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 261294, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "从没见过,我很荣幸能去", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 263994, "dDurationMs": 4200, "segs": [{"utf8": "但与音乐,质量等同的东西", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 268194, "dDurationMs": 6300, "segs": [{"utf8": "音乐。 达娜和我走出去,我们听到", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 274494, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们听说那是墨西哥人", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 277694, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "冠军谁也赢了。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 279994, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们听到了所有这些不同的歌曲, 其中多数我们", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 282794, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "但比原作好点", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 285794, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们以为是录音", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 288594, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们说过没人能弹得那么好", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 290194, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "结果发现是那些有才华的人", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 293694, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "和我们在一起。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 295294, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "我说,丹娜,我们得给他们一个大奖金", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 297994, "dDurationMs": 1500, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们的工作。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 299494, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "我的意思是,我会告诉你, 这无关", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 302394, "dDurationMs": 4400, "segs": [{"utf8": "丹娜也一样,但他们也为总统", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 306794, "dDurationMs": 4600, "segs": [{"utf8": "几个星期前来到这里的中国 为了查尔斯国王", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 311394, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "简直难以置信 他们真是惊人", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 313594, "dDurationMs": 3300, "segs": [{"utf8": "有才华 他们中许多人可能都身处其中", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 316894, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "世界管弦乐队 卡内基音乐厅", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 318894, "dDurationMs": 1700, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们可能在任何地方。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 320594, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "众多. 但是他们喜欢军队", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 322894, "dDurationMs": 1700, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们热爱我们的国家。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 324594, "dDurationMs": 6300, "segs": [{"utf8": "丹娜和我捐了50万美元来表达我们", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 330894, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "非常感谢你的卓越才华", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 334294, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "坚定不移的敬业精神", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 337694, "dDurationMs": 3900, "segs": [{"utf8": "对你所做的一切做出卓越贡献", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 341594, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "包括那些能够", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 344494, "dDurationMs": 1900, "segs": [{"utf8": "你玩得这么好", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 346394, "dDurationMs": 4200, "segs": [{"utf8": "作为总统 我从第一天起就敬佩你", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 350594, "dDurationMs": 1900, "segs": [{"utf8": "我的第一个任期。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 352494, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们会有小事件 而你玩 我说,哇,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 354794, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们是伟大的。 我是说,坏的是你通常都吹了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 357594, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "离开艺术家。 你知道,我们带来了 这些大艺术家,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 359894, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "达纳 大名,但他们把他们炸了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 363294, "dDurationMs": 2556, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们甚至不喜欢看到你出去", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 365850, "dDurationMs": 2919, "segs": [{"utf8": "比他们更有天赋 我不想告诉你", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 368769, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[鼻", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 408069, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[鼻", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 443895, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "干得不错", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 446295, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "我为你感到骄傲", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 449495, "dDurationMs": 3886, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们也很高兴 三个人加入我", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 453381, "dDurationMs": 4114, "segs": [{"utf8": "知道你很熟悉 分享我的伟大", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 457495, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "感谢这个团体的杰出技能。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 460995, "dDurationMs": 4500, "segs": [{"utf8": "一个被大多数人崇拜的人 但他这样做", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 465495, "dDurationMs": 1900, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们嫉妒了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 467395, "dDurationMs": 2500, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们想抓他,但他们不抓他", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 469895, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们喜欢你。 他们不会轻易把他打倒的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 472795, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "他确实很出色 所以我们在委内瑞拉赢了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 475595, "dDurationMs": 1700, "segs": [{"utf8": "48分钟.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 477295, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们把他打得屁滚尿流 我们正在", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 480295, "dDurationMs": 4300, "segs": [{"utf8": "不错 我们很好,但他们已经走了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 484595, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们的空军不见了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 486795, "dDurationMs": 2302, "segs": [{"utf8": "坦率地说,他们的领导人已经走了。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 489097, "dDurationMs": 1500, "segs": [{"utf8": "一切众生已去.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 490597, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们看看我们表现的如何", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 494097, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们正在耐心。 我们很耐心", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 497097, "dDurationMs": 5229, "segs": [{"utf8": "但看着他和凯恩将军和所有人 真是不可思议", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 502326, "dDurationMs": 2371, "segs": [{"utf8": "还有其他人 但我只想介绍一下部长", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 504697, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "战争彼得·赫克塞斯,他一直是明星。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 507797, "dDurationMs": 4100, "segs": [{"utf8": "谢谢你,皮特 非常感谢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 512997, "dDurationMs": 2100, "segs": [{"utf8": "他去和他们合作, 但我不", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 515097, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "记得 他的状态真的很好, 但其中一些家伙是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 517097, "dDurationMs": 2978, "segs": [{"utf8": "很难,对不对? 他们很难相处", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 520075, "dDurationMs": 4422, "segs": [{"utf8": "[鼻]海军代书记洪曹.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 524497, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "谢谢 谢谢你 洪", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 528897, "dDurationMs": 3800, "segs": [{"utf8": "还有海军陆战队司令埃里克·史密斯将军", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 532697, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "非常感谢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 534297, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "谢谢 谢谢你,将军", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 535897, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "中央城堡(英语:Central Castle).", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 538097, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "看来他看起来很棒", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 541497, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "感谢海军陆战队的指挥官", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 544597, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "华盛顿的军营 杰森·科普兰和海军陆战队", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 547797, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "陆军中士胡安·塞古拉。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 550597, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "非常感谢,伙计们。 谢谢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 553497, "dDurationMs": 2500, "segs": [{"utf8": "非常喜欢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 555997, "dDurationMs": 4500, "segs": [{"utf8": "因此,这个精英军乐队的每个成员 继续一个", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 560497, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国音乐传统中珍视的部分", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 563897, "dDurationMs": 5000, "segs": [{"utf8": "如此重大的事情可以追溯到两个多世纪前", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 568897, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "不可思议 建立于1798年.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 572097, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在是1792年,白宫", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 575097, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "这么远之前。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 577097, "dDurationMs": 5400, "segs": [{"utf8": "考虑一下 17 这里建于1792年,所以你是1798年.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 582497, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "根据国会法案 美国海军陆战队每一次", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 585697, "dDurationMs": 2125, "segs": [{"utf8": "除了乔治·华盛顿", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 587822, "dDurationMs": 2185, "segs": [{"utf8": "我不知道那里发生了什么。 一点点,你是一个", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 590007, "dDurationMs": 1990, "segs": [{"utf8": "有一点晚了。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 591997, "dDurationMs": 4600, "segs": [{"utf8": "在州宴会和就职典礼上 通过大堂和", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 596597, "dDurationMs": 4100, "segs": [{"utf8": "伟大的游行,最伟大的游行 任何人见过。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 600697, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "你为美国历史本身提供了音轨", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 603697, "dDurationMs": 3300, "segs": [{"utf8": "达娜有些事情要告诉你 因为...", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 606997, "dDurationMs": 4301, "segs": [{"utf8": "在UFC的战斗中表现非常出色", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 611298, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "你会在谈论这一点, Dana。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 613598, "dDurationMs": 3900, "segs": [{"utf8": "乐队的外号是\"总统的本能\"", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 617498, "dDurationMs": 1800, "segs": [{"utf8": "除了托马斯·杰斐逊", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 619298, "dDurationMs": 2500, "segs": [{"utf8": "我想说,因为 否则,当我说", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 621798, "dDurationMs": 2500, "segs": [{"utf8": "你说特朗普自负", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 624298, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "这家伙的可怕。 他现在声称乐队。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 627898, "dDurationMs": 2500, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以,这是很久以前的我,总统的 自己,但这是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 630398, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "给总统打电话", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 632698, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "它和亚伯拉罕·林肯总统一起去葛底斯堡", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 635698, "dDurationMs": 4800, "segs": [{"utf8": "在传奇作曲家的指导下演奏", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 640498, "dDurationMs": 2500, "segs": [{"utf8": "约翰·菲利普·苏萨.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 642998, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "大相并出为国宝.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 645798, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "你确实是 你是惊人,有才华的人。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 649298, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "才华横溢 我有一个朋友加里·派克非常棒", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 652398, "dDurationMs": 2100, "segs": [{"utf8": "高尔夫球手. 他说才华,都是关于才华的.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 654498, "dDurationMs": 1700, "segs": [{"utf8": "你有天赋", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 656198, "dDurationMs": 3900, "segs": [{"utf8": "而今天,总统的本能 更好,更有天赋,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 660098, "dDurationMs": 1500, "segs": [{"utf8": "我相信,比以往任何时候。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 661598, "dDurationMs": 4200, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们非常爱并尊重你", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 665798, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "顺便说一下,对这里的每一个人来说, 有很多,很多", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 668398, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "可能拒绝的人 要么就是不能这样做", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 671998, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "一定有原因的 说吧 主要是因为有才华", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 675098, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们要最有才华的人", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 677698, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "但是,在非常激动人心的新闻中,我想祝贺你", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 680898, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "本周取得了前所未有的成就。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 683698, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国海军陆战队首次正式成立", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 686498, "dDurationMs": 4200, "segs": [{"utf8": "获得格莱美奖的提名 你要谈谈", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 690698, "dDurationMs": 2203, "segs": [{"utf8": "关于这个,你要去 让人们打电话", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 692901, "dDurationMs": 3697, "segs": [{"utf8": "因为他们应该赢 因为我对音乐很了解", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 696598, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们比上面的人好", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 699298, "dDurationMs": 3700, "segs": [{"utf8": "但你在最佳管弦乐表演的提名中", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 702998, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "最近专辑《约翰·威廉姆斯与The》", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 706998, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "总统自有\"第三卷\".", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 708598, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "不错  That相出.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 711298, "dDurationMs": 3800, "segs": [{"utf8": "我想给你这个特别的原因之一", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 715098, "dDurationMs": 3900, "segs": [{"utf8": "今天的礼物是因为我知道你工作有多辛苦", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 718998, "dDurationMs": 1700, "segs": [{"utf8": "还有你有多努力工作 我看见了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 720698, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "我可能比任何人都看得出来", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 723298, "dDurationMs": 4300, "segs": [{"utf8": "在过去两年里,你是一个难忘的亮点", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 727598, "dDurationMs": 2533, "segs": [{"utf8": "我的就职典礼 你玩的太不可思议了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 730131, "dDurationMs": 2167, "segs": [{"utf8": "事实上,我希望就职典礼能继续", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 732298, "dDurationMs": 2701, "segs": [{"utf8": "一小时 我想听你的音乐,但没用", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 734999, "dDurationMs": 3800, "segs": [{"utf8": "出来。 你表现了神 拯救了国王", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 738799, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "查尔斯三世", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 740399, "dDurationMs": 5000, "segs": [{"utf8": "你为中国国家主席习近平演唱了Les Mis的音乐.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 745399, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "他还在谈论这件事 他昨天说起过", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 748199, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "我当时和他在一起 他说乐队是惊人的,因为他们", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 751299, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们也有非常出色的音乐家。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 753599, "dDurationMs": 1800, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们给了我们一个音乐会。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 755399, "dDurationMs": 3300, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们给我们的节目也是不可思议的。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 758699, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "你为庆祝美国第250届", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 762199, "dDurationMs": 1500, "segs": [{"utf8": "纪念日。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 763699, "dDurationMs": 4300, "segs": [{"utf8": "你甚至还掌握了一些新材料 比如那个", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 767999, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "只有基督教青年会 你表现得很好", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 770699, "dDurationMs": 1500, "segs": [{"utf8": "这已经相当成功。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 772199, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "这是32年前的事了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 774499, "dDurationMs": 2500, "segs": [{"utf8": "这是第五个。 没打到第一", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 776999, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "但几个月来,它是第一。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 778999, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "故为三十二. 区别在于他们有一点点", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 781699, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "像乐队一样重", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 783899, "dDurationMs": 2100, "segs": [{"utf8": "乐队看起来有点不一样,不是完全", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 785999, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "认得,但他们是好人,他们很喜欢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 788899, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们比他们重几磅", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 792099, "dDurationMs": 3700, "segs": [{"utf8": "但是它从5号, 这是一个很大的打击,但", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 795799, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "这是第五个。 没打到第一", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 798099, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "但它打第一 与我们在一起很长一段时间。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 800799, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以当你想到它, 这是相当惊人的,对不对?", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 802799, "dDurationMs": 3300, "segs": [{"utf8": "那首歌你会把它带回来 然后就成了一首破歌", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 806099, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "它告诉你政治的力量,不是吗?", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 809299, "dDurationMs": 2100, "segs": [{"utf8": "下个月我们期待有", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 811399, "dDurationMs": 3900, "segs": [{"utf8": "总统自己为数十位世界顶尖领袖表演", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 815299, "dDurationMs": 5200, "segs": [{"utf8": "当他们在佛罗里达州多拉尔主办G20会议时.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 820499, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "并会相好. 我们有前20名", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 823399, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "全世界领导人都会在那里", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 826199, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "你为我们表演真是荣幸", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 830199, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "你知道,当我说 钱,我们不认为", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 833399, "dDurationMs": 1525, "segs": [{"utf8": "关于这个。 我今早才说的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 834924, "dDurationMs": 1275, "segs": [{"utf8": "我说,我们该怎么办? 好吧,你只是会", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 836199, "dDurationMs": 1900, "segs": [{"utf8": "有个小仪式", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 838099, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "我想感谢张伯伦 无论她在哪里 因为", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 840499, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "她很快就把一切都整理好了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 843099, "dDurationMs": 1700, "segs": [{"utf8": "我说,好吧,他们会玩吗?", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 844799, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "不,他们不是。 我说,等一下,我给他们一个", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 847099, "dDurationMs": 2500, "segs": [{"utf8": "很多钱。 升为五十万.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 849599, "dDurationMs": 2500, "segs": [{"utf8": "让他们演奏点音乐", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 852099, "dDurationMs": 4102, "segs": [{"utf8": "你同意吗? 所以,呃,这是 一种组合在一起。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 856201, "dDurationMs": 2100, "segs": [{"utf8": "然后我说,让我们邀请媒体。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 858301, "dDurationMs": 1900, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以我们邀请了媒体。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 860201, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "经常不是我喜欢的人,但没关系。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 863401, "dDurationMs": 4400, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们都很兴奋,我们有非常好的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 867801, "dDurationMs": 4600, "segs": [{"utf8": "你的小卖部和爱你的人所做的一切", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 872401, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们喜欢为你做美食", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 874801, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以我要你知道 我们非常感激", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 878801, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "约翰·菲利普·索萨(John Philip Sousa)有名地说,想要自己的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 882801, "dDurationMs": 4400, "segs": [{"utf8": "管弦乐队和乐队一样伟大", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 887201, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国。 他说了 你知道结果是什么", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 890701, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "是真的 因为我的音乐朋友", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 893001, "dDurationMs": 3900, "segs": [{"utf8": "生意上说那晚就在这 但有时候", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 896901, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们还说,他们很优秀", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 899101, "dDurationMs": 1700, "segs": [{"utf8": "故为大相.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 900801, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以,我们整理了这个 我对达纳说,我们得做", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 904001, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们有点工作。 所以他们要玩几个", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 906001, "dDurationMs": 1500, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们的歌。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 907501, "dDurationMs": 4400, "segs": [{"utf8": "这儿每个人都有柜子", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 911901, "dDurationMs": 2100, "segs": [{"utf8": "在这里。 我们这里有领导人。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 914001, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们这里有很多将军,很多伟大的,我们有两个", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 916901, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "伟大的将军在这里,我知道 和尊重,我们正在做", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 920401, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "不错 他们有种超凡的天赋", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 923301, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "这就是我们想要的 战争", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 926001, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以,现在我想问我的朋友 Dana White,其中之一", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 928701, "dDurationMs": 4200, "segs": [{"utf8": "真正的传说, 最成功的促进者战斗,但", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 932901, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "我真的认为我可以说 最成功的促进者", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 935301, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "坦白说,什么都行", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 937301, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "他能够做的是 真的不可思议,然后我", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 940801, "dDurationMs": 4100, "segs": [{"utf8": "和Dana一起把支票交给导演", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 944901, "dDurationMs": 1800, "segs": [{"utf8": "瑞安诺伦", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 946701, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "丹娜,如果你能站出来说几句", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 950301, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "我很乐意听 我可以整天听这家伙的话", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 953201, "dDurationMs": 3300, "segs": [{"utf8": "因为他是一个灵感。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 956501, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "受到每个人的尊重 受到最强硬的人的尊重", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 960501, "dDurationMs": 1900, "segs": [{"utf8": "这个世界,因为我认为 他们可能是最艰难的。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 962401, "dDurationMs": 1900, "segs": [{"utf8": "你比他们更坚强", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 964301, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "但每个人都爱并尊重 Dana White.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 967701, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "谢谢你, Dana.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 971376, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 975801, "dDurationMs": 2401, "segs": [{"utf8": "谢谢你,总统先生。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 978202, "dDurationMs": 4500, "segs": [{"utf8": "这个乐队准备了自由250 就像它是一个军队", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 982702, "dDurationMs": 4400, "segs": [{"utf8": "操作。 策划了8周,32首的39首歌", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 987102, "dDurationMs": 4300, "segs": [{"utf8": "不同的艺术家,许多有风俗习惯,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 991402, "dDurationMs": 3900, "segs": [{"utf8": "活动前几天 他们花了整整四天时间", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 995302, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "在烈日中播放我们的作品", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 998402, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "华盛顿的湿度", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1000602, "dDurationMs": 3300, "segs": [{"utf8": "我的制作主管克雷格·博萨里说", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1003902, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "这些家伙穿了全军服", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1007302, "dDurationMs": 1700, "segs": [{"utf8": "复闻入于阳.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1009002, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "当他们站起来时,座位都湿了。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1011702, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "没有抱怨,没有一个 一直抱怨。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1014902, "dDurationMs": 2100, "segs": [{"utf8": "我和很多伟大的团队合作过 我知道", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1017002, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "看起来像人们为自己的工作感到骄傲", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1020002, "dDurationMs": 3300, "segs": [{"utf8": "我在海军陆战队的排练中看到了这一点", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1023302, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "我在自由乐队的每首歌里都听到了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1026502, "dDurationMs": 5400, "segs": [{"utf8": "250. 有几次,像总统说的,一首歌", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1031902, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "我会玩,我会去, 是DJ?", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1035102, "dDurationMs": 3900, "segs": [{"utf8": "DJ在玩吗? 你看看,这是乐队。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1039002, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "听起来和艺术家很像", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1042402, "dDurationMs": 1500, "segs": [{"utf8": "嗯,这是真的惊人的。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1043902, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "我想感谢 呃 [鼻 莱恩中校", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1047502, "dDurationMs": 5700, "segs": [{"utf8": "纳伦 我想感谢道格拉斯·贝利安中校", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1053202, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "炮兵中士斯科特·尼姆纳, 和每一个音乐家和船员", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1056702, "dDurationMs": 3700, "segs": [{"utf8": "帮助完成这项工作的成员,包括加入", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1060402, "dDurationMs": 3900, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们来自陆军、海军和空军", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1064302, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在,我想指出一些事情 真正", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1067302, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "不可思议 专辑可以使用.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1069902, "dDurationMs": 3900, "segs": [{"utf8": "UFC Freedom 250相册在全球发行,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1073802, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在有四百万条溪流", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1077302, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在,我们有一个大音乐部门 在TKR我们的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1080402, "dDurationMs": 3900, "segs": [{"utf8": "连队。 我们有WWE和UFC, 我们使用了很多", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1084302, "dDurationMs": 5300, "segs": [{"utf8": "音乐。 我的音乐人告诉我事实上UFC", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1089602, "dDurationMs": 4500, "segs": [{"utf8": "自由250音乐在第一轮投票中成功", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1094102, "dDurationMs": 4100, "segs": [{"utf8": "今年的格莱美专辑绝对", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1098202, "dDurationMs": 1800, "segs": [{"utf8": "难以置信和难以置信。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1100002, "dDurationMs": 3401, "segs": [{"utf8": "恭喜你们海军陆战队", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1103403, "dDurationMs": 3311, "segs": [{"utf8": "正如总统所说 我希望你们能赢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1106714, "dDurationMs": 2589, "segs": [{"utf8": "这绝对是不可思议的。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1109303, "dDurationMs": 4800, "segs": [{"utf8": "嗯,所以代表大家 在UFC,谢谢你", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1114103, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "几小时后你就会投入 谢谢你的服务,谢谢你", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1117603, "dDurationMs": 3700, "segs": [{"utf8": "给UFC自由250 自己的声音。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1121303, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "跟你共事真是荣幸", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1124903, "dDurationMs": 3300, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在我想谢谢你。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1130703, "dDurationMs": 5100, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在我想介绍瑞安·纳伦中校", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1137748, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1144953, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1149003, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "下午好,女士们,先生们 主席先生,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1152103, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "怀特,非常感谢你的慷慨和", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1155203, "dDurationMs": 3700, "segs": [{"utf8": "继续支持这个不可思议的组织。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1158903, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "指挥官,谢谢你的支持 和在这里。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1161103, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "约翰逊议长,你很荣幸能来", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1164303, "dDurationMs": 3300, "segs": [{"utf8": "秘书先生 也谢谢你的支持", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1167603, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "还有曹秘书 谢谢你能来", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1171003, "dDurationMs": 4100, "segs": [{"utf8": "朋友们,海军陆战队,这个派对是给你的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1175103, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们非常感谢有这个机会为你表演", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1178703, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "今天,主席先生。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1180303, "dDurationMs": 4300, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们非常感谢你对音乐的继续支持", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1184603, "dDurationMs": 2525, "segs": [{"utf8": "还有美国海军陆战队", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1187128, "dDurationMs": 3775, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们有一个特别的节目 我们为你们准备了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1190903, "dDurationMs": 4200, "segs": [{"utf8": "这个组织最早可以追溯到1798年 我们的开始", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1195103, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "国家,正如总统所说。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1197103, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "我最爱的东西,如果我不得不选择", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1199303, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "我最爱的是美国海军陆战队", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1201903, "dDurationMs": 3900, "segs": [{"utf8": "听他们演奏, 这是一个不间断的血统。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1205803, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "你听到的人玩 与人玩过", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1208703, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "曾经为约翰·菲利普演奏过", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1211603, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "苏萨,他为我国的建国而演奏.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1214303, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "如果你想到如何学习音乐和演奏", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1217903, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "综艺,你坐下来,你前面打印出音乐", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1221403, "dDurationMs": 3802, "segs": [{"utf8": "养活你的音乐家", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1225205, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "音乐家 代代相传", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1228705, "dDurationMs": 4300, "segs": [{"utf8": "手相接,心相接,这是活人", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1233005, "dDurationMs": 4500, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国历史和美国音乐史的体现", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1237505, "dDurationMs": 1500, "segs": [{"utf8": "这些音乐家。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1239005, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "这是美国宝藏,总统先生,你", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1241205, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "承认这一点,今天。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1244105, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "White先生,你在UFC的战斗中听到的 和所有这些", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1246805, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们很荣幸能为您效劳", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1249805, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "非常特别的方法。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1252105, "dDurationMs": 2100, "segs": [{"utf8": "这是美国的乐队。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1254205, "dDurationMs": 2100, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们要把它带到每一个家庭,每一个心脏。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1256305, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "海军陆战队可以帮我们每个人", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1258905, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "国家 每一个老兵 每一个悲伤的家庭", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1262305, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "每个音乐爱好者,每个音乐学生,每个", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1265305, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "音乐老师。 海军陆战队就在那里,就像我们一样", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1268805, "dDurationMs": 1500, "segs": [{"utf8": "总统先生,这是给你的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1270305, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "以这种方式服务是一种荣幸,我们不能感谢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1273105, "dDurationMs": 5300, "segs": [{"utf8": "足够你今天来这 难以置信的招待会了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1278405, "dDurationMs": 2789, "segs": [{"utf8": "谢谢你,总统先生。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1281194, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1290364, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1294949, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1304119, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1342765, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1351935, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1361105, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1366345, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1374860, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1379445, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1390006, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以非常感谢你。 我只是注意到 当我坐着,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1393606, "dDurationMs": 2600, "segs": [{"utf8": "我看着那栋漂亮的建筑", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1396206, "dDurationMs": 2460, "segs": [{"utf8": "如果你两年前看到那栋楼的话", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1398666, "dDurationMs": 1740, "segs": [{"utf8": "看起来不太好", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1400406, "dDurationMs": 4600, "segs": [{"utf8": "但通过很多人才 在所有内部,呃我", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1405006, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "我猜你可以说 伟大的专业人士在这里,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1408006, "dDurationMs": 1500, "segs": [{"utf8": "内政部.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1409506, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "非常感谢格雷格和大家 还有道格,道格", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1411906, "dDurationMs": 3800, "segs": [{"utf8": "伯贡. 但是我们很努力地把白色带来", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1415706, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "房子回来了 现在更漂亮了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1418906, "dDurationMs": 2100, "segs": [{"utf8": "很多模具不见了。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1421006, "dDurationMs": 4100, "segs": [{"utf8": "窗户坏了 我们有17个窗户被打破了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1425106, "dDurationMs": 1900, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们有点热,因为他们说,哦,他", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1427006, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "投入时间。 我没有花太多时间, 但我知道如何", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1429206, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "做到这一点。 但我坐在那里看着多么华丽", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1432206, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "建筑是。 记住,白宫也许是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1435806, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "第一,我们国家的头号象征。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1439306, "dDurationMs": 2500, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在,当你看着它, 它是原始的,更美丽", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1441806, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "比在1792年还要好", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1444906, "dDurationMs": 1900, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以,我很荣幸这样做。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1446806, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在我们想听一些伟大的音乐。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1449506, "dDurationMs": 3300, "segs": [{"utf8": "非常感谢各位 谢谢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1452806, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1486867, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1498002, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1509792, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1528132, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1541887, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1550402, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1557607, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1566122, "dDurationMs": 2021, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1577258, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1594943, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1606078, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1610663, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1626383, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1634243, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1647998, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1657824, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1666994, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1673409, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "非常感谢 这是约翰·菲利普·苏萨最", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1676209, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "著名的游行和我们的国家游行 星条旗", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1679409, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "永远 我们现在继续写一篇为", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1682409, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国海军陆战队的海军陆战队", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1685509, "dDurationMs": 4300, "segs": [{"utf8": "这是罗伯特・贾格的Esprit de Corps。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1720704, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1727254, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1731839, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1739044, "dDurationMs": 2021, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1746905, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1752800, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1762625, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1771140, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1783585, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1790135, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1803890, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1845156, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1848112, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "瓳", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1856946, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1867426, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1873976, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1886421, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1892316, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1900831, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1908036, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1955197, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1959782, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1968297, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1975502, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1992532, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 1998513, "dDurationMs": 3800, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们以这种方式为国家服务感到骄傲", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2002313, "dDurationMs": 3800, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们的音乐,就像世界上这么多的音乐", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2006113, "dDurationMs": 4500, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们的下一篇作品向全体服务成员致敬 任何拥有", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2010613, "dDurationMs": 4300, "segs": [{"utf8": "服务,所有现在受到服务影响的人", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2014913, "dDurationMs": 2900, "segs": [{"utf8": "或回到他们的家族世代。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2017813, "dDurationMs": 3110, "segs": [{"utf8": "这个作品叫做\"自由之戒\" 是一部我", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2020923, "dDurationMs": 3190, "segs": [{"utf8": "由著名的旋律\"我的国家\"组成", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2024113, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "尔等. 我专注于歌词之地 我父亲死在那里", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2027513, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "因为没有一天,我们不 想到谁", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2030513, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "为我们牺牲了自由", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2034013, "dDurationMs": 4900, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们有今天。 这是让自由环。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2053448, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2063273, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2073753, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2079648, "dDurationMs": 2021, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2090128, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2098644, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2109124, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2143184, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2151699, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2156939, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2162834, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2168075, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2181175, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2190345, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2205410, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2230300, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2235540, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2244710, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2251915, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2264361, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2278116, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2289416, "dDurationMs": 1500, "segs": [{"utf8": "谢谢各位", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2290916, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在要改头换面", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2292916, "dDurationMs": 4900, "segs": [{"utf8": "我想欢迎一位我们的配音演员上台", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2297816, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "接下来的作品是惊人的格蕾丝", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2300916, "dDurationMs": 4100, "segs": [{"utf8": "这个神奇的恩典是给我们每个人的,但它也在", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2305016, "dDurationMs": 1900, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们敬爱的海军陆战队 如果你听的话", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2306916, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "仔细听,你会听到我们慢慢地插入元素", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2310116, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "海军陆战队的赞美 在整个过程中 神奇的恩典。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2314116, "dDurationMs": 3700, "segs": [{"utf8": "我很高兴能唱这首歌", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2317816, "dDurationMs": 3500, "segs": [{"utf8": "安排了神奇的格蕾丝 我们自己的怀特先生", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2321316, "dDurationMs": 4800, "segs": [{"utf8": "她很好 上士汉娜・戴维斯", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2327241, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2352787, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2358682, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2365232, "dDurationMs": 8515, "segs": [{"utf8": "令人惊讶的恩典, 多么甜蜜", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2373747, "dDurationMs": 7870, "segs": [{"utf8": "[叹息] 声音救了一个苦恼", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2381617, "dDurationMs": 3800, "segs": [{"utf8": "像我一样", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2387117, "dDurationMs": 7590, "segs": [{"utf8": "我曾经迷路,但现在", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2394707, "dDurationMs": 2410, "segs": [{"utf8": "[叹 我被发现了。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2397117, "dDurationMs": 9200, "segs": [{"utf8": "当时是瞎子,但现在我明白了。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2407152, "dDurationMs": 3330, "segs": [{"utf8": "[歌声] [音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2422872, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2428417, "dDurationMs": 7400, "segs": [{"utf8": "那是恩典 教会了我的心", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2435817, "dDurationMs": 9981, "segs": [{"utf8": "以便恐惧, 和恩典解除我的恐惧。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2445798, "dDurationMs": 7220, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐] 多么珍贵的[尖叫][歌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2453018, "dDurationMs": 9900, "segs": [{"utf8": "在我第一次出现的时候", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2462918, "dDurationMs": 2585, "segs": [{"utf8": "相信 [叹", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2475273, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2484443, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2487518, "dDurationMs": 7405, "segs": [{"utf8": "通过许多[唱 [叫喊]危险、劳累和", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2494923, "dDurationMs": 4795, "segs": [{"utf8": "[歌声] snares, I have", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2499818, "dDurationMs": 4600, "segs": [{"utf8": "已经来了。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2509118, "dDurationMs": 7400, "segs": [{"utf8": "带给我安全感的恩典", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2516518, "dDurationMs": 6600, "segs": [{"utf8": "远去,恩典将指引我", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2523118, "dDurationMs": 2100, "segs": [{"utf8": "归家去.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2532318, "dDurationMs": 5800, "segs": [{"utf8": "和恩典将引导,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2538118, "dDurationMs": 3966, "segs": [{"utf8": "我回来了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2542084, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[歌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2546014, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2550599, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2566974, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2576820, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "谢谢 非常感谢大家。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2579220, "dDurationMs": 4300, "segs": [{"utf8": "上士汉娜戴维斯 女士们先生们", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2589720, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们要让汉娜在这里为你唱歌", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2591920, "dDurationMs": 1800, "segs": [{"utf8": "两个我们最后两个选择。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2593720, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "首先,总统先生,你请求 戴维斯小姐和", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2596720, "dDurationMs": 2500, "segs": [{"utf8": "你,这是美国美丽的。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2599220, "dDurationMs": 4300, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们将跟随,呃,上帝保佑美国, 这将", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2603520, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "请大家一起唱", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2606520, "dDurationMs": 3100, "segs": [{"utf8": "总统先生,怀特先生,各位,非常感谢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2609620, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "今天这个机会在这里迎接我们", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2613220, "dDurationMs": 5114, "segs": [{"utf8": "感谢和承认 这些不可思议的音乐家,我", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2618334, "dDurationMs": 1886, "segs": [{"utf8": "拥有领导者的好机会", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2620220, "dDurationMs": 2700, "segs": [{"utf8": "是个指导 照顾好组织", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2622920, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "因为它是委托给我的 我非常感谢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2625320, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "机会。 所以非常感谢你。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2628120, "dDurationMs": 3800, "segs": [{"utf8": "这是美国美丽的。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2656055, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2661295, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2666620, "dDurationMs": 7300, "segs": [{"utf8": "哦,美丽的天空,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2673920, "dDurationMs": 7200, "segs": [{"utf8": "以白杨为谷地,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2681120, "dDurationMs": 6375, "segs": [{"utf8": "为了紫色的 [歌声] 山地的陵墓", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2687495, "dDurationMs": 5246, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]在水果和平原之上。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2692741, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[歌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2695721, "dDurationMs": 2500, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2699941, "dDurationMs": 9480, "segs": [{"utf8": "[歌声]美国,上帝给他的恩典,[歌声]你,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2710321, "dDurationMs": 7600, "segs": [{"utf8": "以兄弟情谊加冕", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2718321, "dDurationMs": 5855, "segs": [{"utf8": "从海入海.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2724176, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[歌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2731381, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2738586, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2747421, "dDurationMs": 5200, "segs": [{"utf8": "哦,美丽为", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2752621, "dDurationMs": 4200, "segs": [{"utf8": "英雄证明在", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2756821, "dDurationMs": 4900, "segs": [{"utf8": "解放纷争,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2762321, "dDurationMs": 7200, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们所爱的不仅仅是自己", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2769521, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "怜悯", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2773221, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "比生活还重要", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2776721, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2780921, "dDurationMs": 7200, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国,上帝保佑他", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2788121, "dDurationMs": 2266, "segs": [{"utf8": "[叹息]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2791421, "dDurationMs": 5500, "segs": [{"utf8": "以你的善行为冠冕,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2796921, "dDurationMs": 2200, "segs": [{"utf8": "兄弟情谊", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2802121, "dDurationMs": 4600, "segs": [{"utf8": "从海到闪耀", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2806721, "dDurationMs": 2100, "segs": [{"utf8": "{\\fn华文楷体\\fs16\\1cHE0E0E0}海", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2809321, "dDurationMs": 3281, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国,美国。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2812602, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[尖叫]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2846007, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[音乐]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2848922, "dDurationMs": 6901, "segs": [{"utf8": "上帝保佑美国, [歌声] 我热爱的土地。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2855823, "dDurationMs": 5099, "segs": [{"utf8": "站在她身边 带她过夜", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2860922, "dDurationMs": 2401, "segs": [{"utf8": "光从上.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2863323, "dDurationMs": 5700, "segs": [{"utf8": "从山上到草原, [歌声] 到海洋", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2869023, "dDurationMs": 9899, "segs": [{"utf8": "白色和泡沫, 上帝保佑美国, 我的家甜蜜的家。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2878922, "dDurationMs": 8351, "segs": [{"utf8": "上帝保佑美国, 我的家甜蜜的家。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2887273, "dDurationMs": 2675, "segs": [{"utf8": "[歌声] [", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2909023, "dDurationMs": 7500, "segs": [{"utf8": "上帝保佑美国, 我的家甜蜜的家。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2916523, "dDurationMs": 8599, "segs": [{"utf8": "上帝保佑美国,我的家乡甜蜜", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2925122, "dDurationMs": 2101, "segs": [{"utf8": "归家去.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 2971224, "dDurationMs": 2300, "segs": [{"utf8": "慢慢来", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}], "wireMagic": "mb1", "lang": "zh-Hans"}